# These .d.ts files are bazel-generated then copied into the source tree
# (grpcviewv1_ts_proto.copy, AGENTS.md) — each has its own copy_test diffing it
# byte-for-byte against a fresh, unformatted codegen run. Reformatting them here
# would just make that test fail.
**/*_pb.d.ts
**/*_connect.d.ts
**/*_connectquery.d.ts

# Request bodies/metadata (AGENTS.md, request-body-contract.md): authored content that
# round-trips byte-identical through the store, and a bare-object body is protojson —
# valid without unquoted keys — as much as it is a TS object literal. Prettier's
# quote-prop stripping and reflow would rewrite that content, not just its whitespace.
**/tree/**/body.ts
**/tree/**/metadata.ts
